SUMMARY:A Litany for Survival: The Life and Work of Audre Lorde - by Black
  Gold
LOCATION:Paradise on Bloor
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://paradiseonbloor.com/movies/a-litany-for-survival-the-life-and-wor
 k-of-audre-lorde\n\nHosted by Black Gold
  (https://www.facebook.com/BlackGoldTO)\n\nThe Toronto premiere of a new
  4k restoration of A Litany for Survival\, which follows iconic poet and
  activist Audre Lorde from her childhood in Harlem through her
  fourteen-year battle with breast cancer. A rich portrait of one of the
