DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://secure.qgiv.com/for/wdrvwf/event/flotillalaw\n\nHosted by The
  Legal Centre for Palestine (https://www.lcpal.ca/)\n\nIsrael has
  responded to the humanitarian aid flotilla movement by illegally
  intercepting and attacking flotilla vessels\, unlawfully detaining
  participants\, blocking access to consular services\, and subjecting
  participants to torture and inhuman and degrading treatment\, including
  acts of sexual violence. This webinar examines these violations in the
  context of both international and Canadian law.
END:VEVENT
